  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5605.12 Release of Information During Hearings Conducted by the Department of Safety",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5605.12 Release of Information During Hearings Conducted by the Department of Safety. Information inserted in motor vehicles files such as reports of hearings examiners or any other orders issued by a hearings examiner, shall not be considered information which is prohibited from disclosure under RSA 260:14.\n\nSource. #7361, EXEMPT, eff 9-1-00; ss by #7621, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-02",
